# Batched rectangle renderer needs raw write access to BufferBuilder's
# per-element memory pointer for our custom GENERIC vertex attributes
# (RectBase, RectSize, Radius, Params, OutlineColor). Vanilla's helper
# methods cover only POSITION/COLOR/UV/NORMAL, so for our SDF data we
# bypass them by calling beginElement(VertexFormatElement) and writing
# the floats directly via MemoryUtil at the returned pointer - same
# pattern vanilla uses internally for its own vertex(...) overloads.
